{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platvese: ABYA's Adventure blends snappy, satisfying platforming with unique post-apocalyptic flair. As small robot ABYA, leap, shoot, and react fast to survive underground ruins\u2014then craft your own levels after beating the main game. Key highlights: </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tool-Based Precision Shooting &amp; Platforming</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ABYA\u2019s floating gun is a multi-functional tool, not a weapon. Use it to trigger switches, move platforms, or grapple upward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No enemy fights\u2014just sync shooting and jumping to outsmart obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670430/extras/ec149eed127fd338878d4907fc81dc78.poster.avif?t=1772007779\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670430/extras/ec149eed127fd338878d4907fc81dc78.webm?t=1772007779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670430/extras/ec149eed127fd338878d4907fc81dc78.mp4?t=1772007779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hardcore Fast-Paced Reactions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think <i>Celeste</i>-level tightness: every jump needs pinpoint landing, every shot perfect timing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miss a ledge? Reset to checkpoints.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nail a one-shot run? Revel in that &quot;perfect clear&quot; rush.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tough but fair\u2014your reflexes win here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670430/extras/9e791046f8c96cdd4ad40e12fbb744d7.poster.avif?t=1772007779\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670430/extras/9e791046f8c96cdd4ad40e12fbb744d7.webm?t=1772007779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670430/extras/9e791046f8c96cdd4ad40e12fbb744d7.mp4?t=1772007779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore &amp; Restore Post-Apoc Underground Ruins</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roam crumbling labs, abandoned factories, and hidden nooks (no sunny overworlds!)\u2014traces of human civilization lie everywhere. These somber, mysterious spaces hold clues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the A.I. Core\u2019s guidance, keep exploring, and become humanity\u2019s savior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670430/extras/47cad29284cbf3b9f13754c9b882b155.poster.avif?t=1772007779\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670430/extras/47cad29284cbf3b9f13754c9b882b155.webm?t=1772007779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670430/extras/47cad29284cbf3b9f13754c9b882b155.mp4?t=1772007779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Custom Level Editing: Build Your Own Fun</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat the main game? Keep the fun going!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The level editor lets you mix core elements: bounce pads, shoot-triggered switches, timed speedruns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make multiplayer co-op &quot;race parties&quot; or high-skill speed challenges\u2014then share with the community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test others\u2019 precision\u2026 or show off your creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670430/extras/06d56784746f7a28c449ed71eec57cf2.poster.avif?t=1772007779\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670430/extras/06d56784746f7a28c449ed71eec57cf2.webm?t=1772007779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670430/extras/06d56784746f7a28c449ed71eec57cf2.mp4?t=1772007779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2670430?t=1772007779","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2670430?t=1772007779","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670430/1586d5b23158a9b2c0fb2e370c0a480d09471be8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772007779","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670430/1586d5b23158a9b2c0fb2e370c0a480d09471be8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772007779","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"descriptio