658/ss_0a1fd26638305d82b70de571f6f7157268417658.600x338.jpg?t=1772007779"},{"id":6,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670430/86936fcba2f56ef1d5a175e062c8e33087265177/ss_86936fcba2f56ef1d5a175e062c8e33087265177.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772007779","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670430/86936fcba2f56ef1d5a175e062c8e33087265177/ss_86936fcba2f56ef1d5a175e062c8e33087265177.600x338.jpg?t=1772007779"},{"id":7,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670430/0944d24d9d5c95c9b9f683b9dd5b41142f43281c/ss_0944d24d9d5c95c9b9f683b9dd5b41142f43281c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772007779","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670430/0944d24d9d5c95c9b9f683b9dd5b41142f43281c/ss_0944d24d9d5c95c9b9f683b9dd5b41142f43281c.600x338.jpg?t=1772007779"}],"short_description":"A hardcore platform-action game! Robot ABYA wakes up in the depths of end - times ruins. With a special water gun, it starts to uncover the apocalypse's truth. As it explores underground ruins, ABYA leaps, climbs, and shoots, pushing survival limits and gradually revealing doomsday mysteries.","steam_appid":2670430,"support_info":{"email":"kane@ugdap.com","url":"https://discord.gg/fjFEAtmrja"},"supported_languages":"English, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Japanese, Korean, French<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}